Boundary notes:
  endpoint-detection-response = vendor-neutral EDR/XDR strategy, endpoint detection methodology,
  telemetry and hunting, response and tuning, and platform selection. It does NOT own SIEM/SOAR
  correlation (siem-soar-investigation), network-side sensors (network-detection-response), or the
  identity surface that credential-access attacks target (identity-access-management). The EDR
  vendor skills (crowdstrike, defender-endpoint, sentinelone, carbon-black, cortex-xdr, elastic-
  defend, sophos, wazuh) are skipped/refer-only in this vault per the generic-only disposition;
  this umbrella names them as routing context only.

